# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Remora settings folders
#
# Settings files are usually specific to one deployment, site or instrument,
# and are not useful to other people -- but they live alongside the shared
# defaults, so they get committed by accident. Everything in a Remora settings
# folder is therefore ignored by default.
#
# To share a settings file deliberately, name it so one of the exceptions
# below matches: *default*, *_init.m, *example* or *template*.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Remoras/*/settings/*
!Remoras/*/settings/*default*
!Remoras/*/settings/*Default*
!Remoras/*/settings/*_init.m
!Remoras/*/settings/*example*
!Remoras/*/settings/*Example*
!Remoras/*/settings/*template*
!Remoras/*/settings/*Template*
!Remoras/*/settings/README*

# Third-party binaries that are used but not redistributed here.
#
# The precedent in this repo is Extras/dd/dd.exe, which is committed *with* its
# Copying.txt -- GPL and similar licences require the licence to accompany the
# binary. We do not have licence text for the files below, so they are left out
# rather than distributed incorrectly. Each is obtainable from its vendor;
# Extras/msdxfer/msdxfer_setup_210209.txt says where, and
# Remoras/HARPproc/README.md explains the consequence.
#
# To include any of them: add the licence file alongside and drop the line here.
Remoras/HARPproc/pdftk.exe
Remoras/HARPproc/libiconv2.dll
Extras/msdxfer/FT_Prog_v3.10.132.511 Installer.exe
Extras/msdxfer/USBDeview.exe
Extras/msdxfer/USBDeview.cfg
Extras/msdxfer/ftd2xx.dll
